     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/4/0/csm_roboBox_info_Ein-Ausgabemodul_7e6416b756.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 616,
     "h": 334,
     "title": "State-of-the-art input/output module",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>State-of-the-art input/output module</h3> <p>Input/output module for the »smartPallet« system – used to securely hold your tool pallets. The tool pallets can be delivered either with the manual pallet truck or the »coraExpress« driverless transport system.</p> </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/e/7/csm_roboBox_info_Roboterbasismodul_3a24db0e88.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 616,
     "h": 334,
     "title": "Intelligent robot base module",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Intelligent robot base module</h3> <p>Robot base module – where the FANUC 6-axis articulated arm robot grips the tools and transports them reliably between the various modules.</p> </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/1/a/csm_roboBox_info_Montagemodule_c2aef185f8.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 616,
     "h": 334,
     "title": "Innovative assembly modules",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Innovative assembly modules</h3> <p>Assembly modules – for processing tools. With the variable assembly modules, tools can be shrunk in and out, cooled, measured, clamped vertically, and pressed in and out within the »roboBox«.</p> </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/f/1/csm_roboBox_info_Messmodul_0876459bc5.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 616,
     "h": 334,
     "title": "High-precision measuring module",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>High-precision measuring module</h3> <p>Measuring module – into which the tool for measurement is inserted. The measuring process itself starts automatically.</p> </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/7/7/csm_roboBox_info_Steuerungssoftware_43a2601b27.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 616,
     "h": 334,
     "title": "Server-based control software",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Server-based control software</h3> <p>Control software – for operating the automation system. The control software can be displayed on various display devices (monitor, tablet, or smartphone).</p> </figcaption>"
    }
